          },
          "b": {
            "w": "têm",
            "pos": "they have (plural)",
            "ex": "Os meus pais <b>têm</b> dois gatos."
          },
          "why": "The 3rd person plural of ter has a circumflex: eles têm. The singular tem has no accent. The circumflex shows the difference you hear in the plural.",
          "tr": {},
          "check": {
